---
/** /widebeam SOUND key (lane A), position: fixed; placed by furniture.ts. Its name is its visible text (no aria-label,
 *  a11y-11 / demo-12); aria-pressed carries the state. sound.ts (lane D) owns the click and toggles both the [data-face]
 *  text ("Sound off" / "Sound on") and aria-pressed. On phones it is a 44 px round key: the text is clipped visually,
 *  never display:none, so it stays the name. */
---
<button type="button" class="wb-sound" data-wb-sound data-wb-demo aria-pressed="false"><span class="wb-eq" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="wb-sound-face" data-face>Sound off</span></button>
